ify a time would that mean he stayed there till till mesmerized wore off?)</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. Honestly, the vampire is being exceedingly generous for teaching the young hunter the better parts of knowledge and preparation. Namely, you <i>need it</i>. Maybe they could Ghoul them and show them the ropes.<br /> <br /> Kinda reminds me of this: <a href=\"http://www.giantitp.com/comics/oots0442.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.giantitp.com/comics/oots0442.html</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T18:53:08-07:00","id":1207831,"title":"","content":"Would the teen just stand there till morning if the vamp didnt specify a time duration?<br /> <br /> was morbidly curious.<br /> <br /> other idea that might accomplish same effect is tell them to write 200 lines of &quot;I am not a police officer&quot;<br /> <br /> oh is intimidate or subterfuge the best roll to make sure he understands your message? <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T04:45:19-07:00","id":1207934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1153169-monster-hunter-s-better-to-coopt-or-manipulate-from-a-distance?p=1207831#post1207831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would the teen just stand there till morning if the vamp didnt specify a time duration?<br /> <br /> was morbidly curious.<br /> <br /> other idea that might accomplish same effect is tell them to write 200 lines of &amp;quot;I am not a police officer&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> oh is intimidate or subterfuge the best roll to make sure he understands your message? <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Simple Skill use isn't going to get the message across. If you have Dominate or Majesty, take them to the edge of behavior they would even consider, like wiring their house to blow on trigger. Once the command/influence wears off, drive home what you <i>could</i> have made them do. If you lack 